<p>You make all your putrescent pustules explode at once, splashing all creatures in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> with black fluids that deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> darkness damage per pustule and healing you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 59</acronym> per pustule.</p>